<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Streams and rivers and brooks and lakes,</l><l>There are oceans and waterfalls and seas.</l><l>We can swim, take a bath, jump in puddles too!</l><l>Wash our hands and drink a cuppa tea!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
